# 9️⃣ Construct Binary Tree from Inorder and Postorder

The same idea can be used with:

```text
Inorder + Postorder
```

Important observation:

```text
Postorder Last Element = Root
```

Then use Inorder to divide:

```text
Left Subtree

Right Subtree
```

---

# 🔟 Tree Construction Rule

Remember:

### Preorder + Inorder

```text
Preorder First = Root
```

### Postorder + Inorder

```text
Postorder Last = Root
```

### Inorder

Used to determine:

```text
Left Subtree

Right Subtree
```

